Read AGENTS.md, docs/CONTRACTS.md, and your assigned prompts/ file before implementation.

The user wants a real working application, not a static dashboard. Respect exclusive file ownership and the coordinator's contract freeze. Preserve uncommitted work and .env.local. Do not reveal secrets.

Keep source data, original values, dataset versions, corrections, chart configuration, and provenance separate. Never claim AI extraction is verified because it is valid JSON. Do not invent product/demo data or performance claims. Missing values stay missing. All material transformations are explicit and reversible.

Use actual integrations and honest unavailable states. When adding dependencies or provider APIs, consult their current primary documentation. Report what you actually ran and measured.
